s.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c36253591c8406b8END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4fa90444e1235849END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_DrunkSailorPocketNote02</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_DrunkSailorPocketNote02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_DrunkSailorPocketNote02\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">dbe2b669-17ec-4746-9991-e434ea11003d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dbe2b669-17ec-4746-9991-e434ea11003d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dbe2b669-17ec-4746-9991-e434ea11003d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by drunk musician <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Syllabub_Fran\" title=\"Syllabub Fran\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png/25px-Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png/38px-Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png/50px-Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Syllabub Fran\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png/25px-Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Portrait_Syllabub_Fran.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Syllabub_Fran\" title=\"Syllabub Fran\">Syllabub Fran</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Shimmer, you are on your last damn chance. I am your manager, not your bloody understudy. I had to throw a wig on the other day and shake my arse like an eel in a frenzy - well, no more! We can't keep hoping the crowd is too drunk to notice my chest hair. \n</p><p><br>\nFrom now on, you're showing up <i>sober</i> and <i>early</i>.  And if I catch so much as whiff of drink on you, you're out on your arse and Hank the Wobbler is taking your spot.  SOBER, Shimmer - I mean it this time.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1734/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28646/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8459/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recurs